 "comment": "The lessons (D-1026). Each lesson holds a kind of D-281 and its forms. Each form names an ability of the ability file, the point total that opens it, its AP cost, at least 1 (D-1197, D-1213), and its description, and the first form opens at zero (D-539, D-1027). The name of a lesson and of a form is `name.` and the name part of its id, and no two forms name one ability (D-1032). The fixture lessons of PR-12 cover six kinds: Mend, Harm, Blight, Boon, Blade, and Shot (D-1029). PR-13 adds a Theft drill with the steal (D-950). PR-17 adds the lessons of the first playable (D-1353, D-1355), and PR-42 writes the rest of region one. Each id is permanent (D-166).",
